      "text": "Pillar 1 of the AUKUS partnership focuses on Australia acquiring nuclear-powered attack submarines and the rotational basing of US and UK nuclear-powered attack submarines in Australia. This effort is a significant aspect of the partnership, enhancing Australia's naval capabilities.",
      "date": "2021-09-15"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Pillar 2: Advanced Capabilities Development",
      "text": "Pillar 2 involves the collaborative development of advanced capabilities in six technological areas: undersea capabilities, quantum technologies, artificial intelligence and autonomy, advanced cyber, hypersonic and counter-hypersonic capabilities, and electronic warfare. It also includes two broader functional areas: innovation and information sharing.",
