      "headline": "Bombings Occur",
      "text": "On August 7, 1998, two nearly simultaneous truck bomb explosions occurred at the United States embassies in Dar es Salaam, Tanzania, and Nairobi, Kenya. More than 220 people were killed in these attacks.",
      "date": "1998-08-07"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Immediate Aftermath",
      "text": "In the immediate aftermath of the bombings, rescue operations were conducted to save those trapped in the rubble. The attacks resulted in widespread destruction and a significant number of casualties.",
