      "headline": "Incident at Ye Olde Hob Inn",
      "text": "On the evening of June 24, 1943, an incident occurred at Ye Olde Hob Inn in Bamber Bridge, where military police attempted to arrest several African American soldiers, leading to a confrontation.",
