      "headline": "Foundation of the Khmer Empire",
      "text": "The Khmer Empire was founded in 802 CE when Jayavarman II declared himself the universal monarch (chakravartin) and established the capital at Hariharalaya, near present-day Siem Reap, Cambodia.",
      "date": "0802"
