      "headline": "Renaming to Place de la Révolution",
      "text": "During the French Revolution in 1792, the square was renamed Place de la Révolution. It became the site of the guillotine where King Louis XVI and Marie Antoinette, among others, were executed.",
      "date": "1792"
    },
