      "headline": "Emergence of the Beat Generation",
      "text": "The Beat Generation, a group of influential writers and artists, began to emerge during the era of the Silent Generation's maturing, from as early as 1946 to as late as 1963. They were known for their rejection of mainstream American culture and their exploration of spirituality, drugs, sexuality, and travel.",
