      "headline": "Operation Barbarossa",
      "text": "On June 22, 1941, Germany launched Operation Barbarossa, the invasion of the Soviet Union.",
      "date": "1941-06-22"
    },
    {
      "headline": "D-Day Invasion",
      "text": "On June 6, 1944, Allied forces launched the D-Day invasion, marking the beginning of the liberation of Western Europe from Nazi control.",
      "date": "1944-06-06"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Hitler's Death",
      "text": "Adolf Hitler died by suicide on April 30, 1945, in his bunker in Berlin as Allied forces closed in on the city.",
