      "headline": "Convictions",
      "text": "In 2003, John Bunting and Robert Wagner were convicted of multiple murders and sentenced to life imprisonment without the possibility of parole. James Vlassakis was sentenced to life imprisonment with a non-parole period of 26 years. Mark Haydon was convicted of helping to dispose of the bodies.",
      "date": "2003"
    }
  ]
