    },
    {
      "headline": "Han Dynasty Advancements",
      "text": "During the Han dynasty (206 BCE–220 CE), qigong was documented in medical texts and became associated with longevity practices.",
      "date": "-0206"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Buddhist Influence",
      "text": "In the 5th century CE, qigong was influenced by Buddhist practices, particularly through the introduction of meditation techniques.",
      "date": "0400"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Development of Martial Arts Qigong",
      "text": "By the Tang dynasty (618–907 CE), qigong was incorporated into martial arts training, enhancing physical strength and resilience.",
      "date": "0618"
    },
    {
