      "headline": "Establishment of the Sultanate of Zanzibar",
      "text": "The Sultanate of Zanzibar was established in 1856 following the death of Said bin Sultan, the Sultan of Muscat and Oman. His sons, Majid and Thuwaini, divided his empire, with Majid becoming the first Sultan of Zanzibar.",
