      "headline": "Heraclitus Writes 'On Nature'",
      "text": "Heraclitus wrote a single work, traditionally referred to as 'On Nature,' which was divided into three discourses: one on the universe, another on politics, and a third on theology. The exact date of this work is unknown, but it was influential in ancient philosophy.",
      "date": "-0500"
    },
