      "headline": "Establishment of the Spencer Family",
      "text": "The Spencer family is an aristocratic British family that rose to prominence in the 16th century. They have held numerous titles, including the dukedom of Marlborough, the earldoms of Sunderland and Spencer, and the Churchill barony.",
      "date": "1500"
