      "text": "The Turner Diaries was published in 1978. It is a novel written by William Luther Pierce under the pseudonym Andrew Macdonald. The book depicts a violent revolution in the United States, leading to the overthrow of the federal government, a nuclear war, and a race war resulting in the systematic extermination of non-whites and Jews.",
