    {
      "headline": "Jean-Léon Gérôme's 'The Snake Charmer'",
      "text": "In 1879, Jean-Léon Gérôme painted 'The Snake Charmer', a quintessential example of Orientalist art that portrayed an exoticized view of Eastern culture.",
      "date": "1879"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Publication of 'Orientalism' by Edward Said",
