      "text": "In 1943, Ignacio 'Nacho' Anaya created the dish known as nachos for American customers at the Victory Club restaurant in Piedras Negras, Coahuila, Mexico. The dish originally consisted of tortilla chips topped with melted cheese and jalapeños.",
