      "headline": "Earliest Settlement",
      "text": "Jaffa is believed to have been settled as early as 7500 BCE, making it one of the oldest port cities in the world.",
      "date": "-7500"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Egyptian Rule",
      "text": "During the 15th century BCE, Jaffa was conquered by the Egyptians under Pharaoh Thutmose III.",
