      "headline": "Trident II as Part of U.S. Strategic Nuclear Triad",
      "text": "The Trident II became a key element of the U.S. strategic nuclear triad, enhancing U.S. strategic deterrence with its improved accuracy, payload, and range compared to the earlier Trident C-4.",
