      "headline": "Payload Flexibility and Treaty Compliance",
      "text": "The Trident II's payload flexibility allows it to accommodate various treaty requirements, such as the New START treaty, ensuring compliance with international arms control agreements.",
      "date": "1990"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Durable Sea-Based System",
      "text": "The Trident II is considered a durable sea-based system capable of engaging many targets, providing a reliable component of nuclear deterrence.",
