      "headline": "Film Release",
      "text": "Something the Lord Made premiered on HBO on May 30, 2004. The film is a biographical drama about the partnership between Vivien Thomas and Alfred Blalock, focusing on their groundbreaking work in cardiac surgery.",
      "date": "2004-05-30"
    },
