      "headline": "Publication of 'Poems, Chiefly in the Scottish Dialect'",
      "text": "In July 1786, Burns published his first major volume of work, 'Poems, Chiefly in the Scottish Dialect', in Kilmarnock, which brought him immediate success.",
      "date": "1786-07"
