      "text": "Parikshit was born to Abhimanyu and Uttara, making him the grandson of Arjuna and Subhadra, and a member of the Kuru dynasty. His birth is significant in the Mahabharata as he was the only surviving heir of the Pandavas after the Kurukshetra War.",
