      "headline": "Conquest by New Kingdom of Egypt",
      "text": "Around 1500 BCE, the New Kingdom of Egypt under Pharaoh Thutmose I conquers the Kerma culture, and Egyptian rule is established over Nubia.",
      "date": "-1500"
