      "headline": "Kushite Conquest of Egypt",
      "text": "In the 8th century BCE, the Kingdom of Kush, under the leadership of King Piye, conquers Egypt and establishes the 25th Dynasty.",
      "date": "-0750"
    },
    {
      "headline": "End of the 25th Dynasty",
      "text": "The 25th Dynasty, also known as the Kushite Dynasty, ends around 656 BCE when the Assyrians invade Egypt and drive the Kushites back to Nubia.",
      "date": "-0656"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Meroitic Period Begins",
      "text": "Around 300 BCE, the Meroitic period begins in Nubia, marked by the establishment of Meroë as the capital of the Kingdom of Kush.",
      "date": "-0300"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Decline of the Kingdom of Kush",
      "text": "The Kingdom of Kush begins to decline around 350 CE, due to internal strife and external pressures, including invasions by the Kingdom of Axum.",
      "date": "0350"
    }
  ]
}

