      "headline": "Finnish Declaration of War",
      "text": "On 25 June 1941, Finland declared war on the Soviet Union, marking the beginning of the Continuation War. This was part of a coordinated effort with Nazi Germany during World War II.",
      "date": "1941-06-25"
