      "headline": "Introduction of Japanese Kickboxing",
      "text": "In 1966, Japanese kickboxing was introduced by Tatsuo Yamada and Osamu Noguchi. This style combined Muay Thai and karate, and it became popular in Japan as a competitive sport.",
