      "headline": "Annexation by Prussia",
      "text": "In 1866, after the Austro-Prussian War, the Electorate of Hesse-Kassel was annexed by Prussia.",
      "date": "1866"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Formation of the State of Hesse",
      "text": "The modern State of Hesse was established in 1945 after World War II, combining parts of the former Prussian provinces and the People's State of Hesse.",
      "date": "1945"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Hesse joins the Federal Republic of Germany",
