      "text": "Teresa of Ávila was born on March 28, 1515, in Gotarrendura, Ávila, Spain.",
      "date": "1515-03-28"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Entry into Carmelite Convent",
      "text": "In 1535, Teresa entered the Carmelite Convent of the Incarnation in Ávila.",
      "date": "1535"
