      "headline": "Recognition of Lithium's Effectiveness in Depression",
      "text": "Over the years, lithium has also been recognized for its effectiveness in treating major depressive disorder, particularly in augmenting the effects of other antidepressants.",
      "date": "1980s"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Ongoing Research and Usage",
      "text": "Research continues into the mechanisms of lithium's effects and its potential uses in other psychiatric and neurological disorders. It remains a widely used treatment for bipolar disorder.",
      "date": "2020s"
