      "text": "During the 17th and 18th centuries, the Enlightenment was a period where egalitarian ideas began to take shape, emphasizing reason, science, and individual rights. Philosophers like John Locke and Jean-Jacques Rousseau contributed to the development of egalitarian thought.",
