    },
    {
      "headline": "French Revolution",
      "text": "In 1789, the French Revolution was a pivotal event that promoted egalitarian principles, with the Declaration of the Rights of Man and of the Citizen proclaiming that 'men are born and remain free and equal in rights.'",
