    },
    {
      "headline": "Abolition of Slavery",
      "text": "Throughout the 19th century, egalitarianism influenced movements to abolish slavery, leading to significant legal changes such as the Emancipation Proclamation in 1863 in the United States.",
      "date": "1863"
    },
    {
