      "headline": "Trial Begins",
      "text": "The trial for Liebeck v. McDonald's Restaurants began in August 1994 in the New Mexico District Court.",
      "date": "1994-08"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Jury Verdict",
      "text": "On August 18, 1994, the jury awarded Stella Liebeck $200,000 in compensatory damages, which was reduced to $160,000 because they found her 20% at fault, and $2.7 million in punitive damages, which was later reduced by the judge to $480,000.",
      "date": "1994-08-18"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Case Settled",
      "text": "The case was settled out of court for an undisclosed amount, which was less than $600,000, after the verdict was appealed.",
      "date": "1994"
    }
  ]
}

