      "headline": "Proclamation of the Korean Empire",
      "text": "On October 12, 1897, King Gojong of the Joseon dynasty proclaimed the establishment of the Korean Empire, marking the transition from the Joseon dynasty to an empire.",
      "date": "1897-10-12"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Gwangmu Reform",
      "text": "The Gwangmu Reform was a series of reforms initiated by Emperor Gojong to modernize Korea, starting in 1897. These reforms included military, economic, and educational changes.",
