      "headline": "Origin of Durga Puja",
      "text": "Durga Puja is an annual festival originating in the Indian subcontinent which reveres and pays homage to the Hindu goddess Durga. It celebrates Durga's victory over the buffalo demon Mahishasura.",
      "date": "-1500"
