      "date": "2017-11"
    },
    {
      "headline": "CFTC Subpoena",
      "text": "In December 2017, the Commodity Futures Trading Commission (CFTC) issued subpoenas to Bitfinex and Tether, raising questions about Tether's claims of being fully backed by US dollars.",
