      "text": "In April 2019, the New York Attorney General's office announced an investigation into Bitfinex and Tether, alleging that Bitfinex used Tether's reserves to cover up a loss of $850 million.",
      "date": "2019-04"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Settlement with New York Attorney General",
      "text": "In February 2021, Tether and Bitfinex reached a settlement with the New York Attorney General's office, agreeing to pay $18.5 million and improve transparency without admitting any wrongdoing.",
      "date": "2021-02"
