      "headline": "Initial Results",
      "text": "On election night, state results tallied gave 246 electoral votes to Republican nominee Texas Governor George W. Bush and 255 to Democratic nominee Vice President Al Gore, with Florida's 25 electoral votes too close to call.",
      "date": "2000-11-07"
    },
