    {
      "headline": "Foundation of the Académie Française",
      "text": "In 1635, Richelieu founded the Académie Française, an institution aimed at standardizing the French language.",
      "date": "1635"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Death of Cardinal Richelieu",
      "text": "Cardinal Richelieu died on December 4, 1642, in Paris, France, after serving as Chief Minister for 18 years.",
