      "text": "The Treaty of Paris was signed on September 3, 1783, ending the American Revolutionary War and establishing the initial boundary between the United States and British North America (now Canada).",
      "date": "1783-09-03"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Jay Treaty",
      "text": "The Jay Treaty was signed on November 19, 1794, resolving issues remaining since the Treaty of Paris and facilitating ten years of peaceful trade between the United States and British North America.",
