      "headline": "First Performance of Oedipus Rex",
      "text": "The play Oedipus Rex, also known as Oedipus Tyrannus or Oedipus the King, is believed to have been first performed around 429 BC. This date is highly uncertain, but it is the most commonly accepted timeframe for its debut.",
      "date": "-0429"
