      "headline": "Containment of the Camp Fire",
      "text": "The Camp Fire was contained on Sunday, November 25, 2018, after burning 153,336 acres (62,050 ha).",
      "date": "2018-11-25"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Impact and Damage",
      "text": "The Camp Fire caused 85 fatalities, displaced more than 50,000 people, and destroyed more than 18,000 structures, causing an estimated $16.5 billion in damage.",
      "date": "2018"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Most Expensive Natural Disaster of 2018",
      "text": "The Camp Fire was the most expensive natural disaster of 2018, largely due to the extensive damage and destruction it caused.",
      "date": "2018"
