      "text": "The Duchy of Schleswig was established in the early Middle Ages as a fiefdom of the Danish crown.",
      "date": "-0800"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Formation of the Duchy of Holstein",
      "text": "The Duchy of Holstein was established in 1111 as a fiefdom of the Holy Roman Empire.",
