      "text": "According to the New Testament, Jesus was born in Bethlehem. The exact date is not specified, but it is traditionally celebrated on December 25th in the Gregorian calendar.",
      "date": "-0004"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Baptism by John the Baptist",
      "text": "Jesus was baptized by John the Baptist in the River Jordan, marking the beginning of his public ministry. This event is believed to have occurred around 27-29 AD.",
