      "headline": "Massacre Continues in the Provinces",
      "text": "The massacre spread to other cities and provinces in France, continuing into September 1572. The violence resulted in the deaths of thousands more Huguenots.",
      "date": "1572-09"
    },
    {
      "headline": "End of the Massacre",
      "text": "By the end of September 1572, the violence had largely subsided, but the massacre had a lasting impact on the French Wars of Religion and the Huguenot community.",
      "date": "1572-09"
    }
  ]
