    {
      "headline": "Resolution of the Maelius Affair",
      "text": "Cincinnatus dealt with the crisis by appointing Gaius Servilius Ahala as his magister equitum, who killed Maelius. Cincinnatus then resigned his dictatorship.",
      "date": "-0439"
