      "headline": "Founding of the National Patriotic Front of Liberia (NPFL)",
      "text": "In 1989, Charles Taylor founded the National Patriotic Front of Liberia (NPFL) and launched an armed rebellion against President Samuel Doe, marking the beginning of the First Liberian Civil War.",
      "date": "1989"
