      "headline": "Murder of Louis Gumpenberger",
      "text": "On August 16, 2016, Pam Hupp shot and killed Louis Gumpenberger in her home in O'Fallon, Missouri. She claimed self-defense, stating that Gumpenberger pursued her into her home wielding a knife.",
      "date": "2016-08-16"
