      "headline": "Dota 2 Reborn",
      "text": "In June 2015, Valve announced Dota 2 Reborn, an overhaul of the game featuring a new engine, interface, and custom game modes. The update was fully released in September 2015.",
      "date": "2015-09"
    },
    {
      "headline": "The International 2016",
      "text": "The International 2016 took place in August 2016, with a record-breaking prize pool of over $20 million, highlighting the growing popularity and financial success of Dota 2 esports.",
      "date": "2016-08"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Dota 2's 7.00 Update",
      "text": "In December 2016, Valve released the 7.00 update, one of the most significant updates in Dota 2's history. It introduced a new hero, major gameplay changes, and a new user interface.",
      "date": "2016-12"
