    },
    {
      "headline": "Marriage to Catherine of Aragon",
      "text": "Arthur married Catherine of Aragon on 14 November 1501 at St. Paul's Cathedral in London. Catherine was the daughter of the Catholic Monarchs of Spain, Ferdinand II of Aragon and Isabella I of Castile.",
