    },
    {
      "headline": "Death of Arthur, Prince of Wales",
      "text": "Arthur, Prince of Wales, died on 2 April 1502 at Ludlow Castle in Shropshire, England, likely from an illness such as tuberculosis or the sweating sickness.",
