      "date": "-0700"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Selection and Service",
      "text": "Vestal Virgins were selected as young girls, typically between the ages of six and ten, and were required to serve for 30 years. Their service was divided into three decades: learning, performing, and teaching.",
      "date": "-0700"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Privileges and Punishments",
      "text": "Vestal Virgins enjoyed privileges such as emancipation from their father's authority and the ability to own property. However, they faced severe punishments for breaking their vow of chastity, including being buried alive.",
      "date": "-0700"
