      "headline": "Kingdom of Asturias Established",
      "text": "The Kingdom of Asturias was established in 718 by Pelagius, who became its first king after defeating the Moors at the Battle of Covadonga.",
      "date": "0718"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Battle of Covadonga",
      "text": "In 722, Pelagius of Asturias won the Battle of Covadonga, marking the beginning of the Christian Reconquista of the Iberian Peninsula.",
      "date": "0722"
