      "headline": "Merger to form ABB",
      "text": "On January 5, 1988, ASEA of Sweden and BBC of Switzerland merged to form ABB (Asea Brown Boveri), creating a global leader in power and automation technologies.",
      "date": "1988-01-05"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Acquisition of Combustion Engineering",
      "text": "In 1990, ABB acquired the American company Combustion Engineering, expanding its capabilities in power generation and automation.",
      "date": "1990"
