    },
    {
      "headline": "Vandal Kingdom at its Peak",
      "text": "By the late 5th century, the Vandal Kingdom in North Africa was at its height, controlling parts of the Mediterranean, including Sicily, Sardinia, Corsica, and the Balearic Islands.",
      "date": "0500"
