      "headline": "Birth of Aeneas",
      "text": "Aeneas was born to the Trojan prince Anchises and the Greek goddess Aphrodite. His birth is a significant event in Greco-Roman mythology, marking him as a demigod and a key figure in the Trojan lineage.",
      "date": "-1200"
    },
