      "text": "The discovery of gold in 1851 led to the Victorian Gold Rush, significantly increasing the population and wealth of the colony.",
      "date": "1851"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Establishment of the University of Melbourne",
      "text": "The University of Melbourne was established in 1853, becoming the second university in Australia.",
      "date": "1853"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Melbourne Becomes Capital of Australia",
      "text": "From 1901 to 1927, Melbourne served as the temporary capital of Australia while Canberra was being constructed.",
      "date": "1901"
