      "headline": "Establishment of IEEE 754",
      "text": "The IEEE 754 standard for floating-point arithmetic was established in 1985 by the Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers (IEEE). This standard addressed many problems found in the diverse floating-point implementations that made them difficult to use reliably and portably.",
      "date": "1985"
