      "headline": "Deep Learning Resurgence",
      "text": "In the 2000s and 2010s, backpropagation played a crucial role in the resurgence of deep learning, enabling the training of deep neural networks with many layers, which led to breakthroughs in fields like computer vision and natural language processing.",
