      "headline": "First Contact with the Tribbles",
      "text": "In 2268, Kirk dealt with the infestation of Tribbles on the space station K-7, an event known as 'The Trouble with Tribbles'.",
      "date": "2268"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Kirk's Temporary Promotion to Admiral",
      "text": "In 2270, after completing his five-year mission, Kirk was promoted to Admiral and assigned to Starfleet Command.",
      "date": "2270"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Return to Command of the Enterprise",
      "text": "In 2271, Kirk returned to command the USS Enterprise to deal with the V'Ger crisis.",
      "date": "2271"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Kirk's Death",
      "text": "James T. Kirk died in 2371 on Veridian III while helping to stop Dr. Tolian Soran from destroying a star.",
