    {
      "headline": "Reign of Clovis I",
      "text": "Clovis I, the first King of the Franks to unite all of the Frankish tribes under one ruler, reigned from 481 to 511 AD. His reign marked the beginning of the Merovingian dynasty.",
      "date": "0481"
