    },
    {
      "headline": "Display in the Musée du Luxembourg",
      "text": "After its acquisition, 'Liberty Leading the People' was displayed in the Musée du Luxembourg in Paris, which was dedicated to contemporary art at the time.",
      "date": "1831"
