      "text": "The region of Thrace has been inhabited since the Neolithic period, with evidence of early settlements dating back to around 6000 BCE.",
      "date": "-6000"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Thracian Kingdoms",
      "text": "By the 5th century BCE, Thrace was home to several Thracian tribes and kingdoms, including the Odrysian Kingdom, which was the most powerful.",
