      "text": "In the late 14th century, Thrace was conquered by the Ottoman Empire, with the conquest completed by 1453.",
      "date": "1453"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Balkan Wars",
      "text": "During the Balkan Wars of 1912-1913, Thrace was a major battleground, leading to significant territorial changes in the region.",
      "date": "1912"
