      "headline": "Contemporary Sex Industry in Japan",
      "text": "Despite the Prostitution Prevention Law, the Japanese sex industry continues to prosper, with an estimated annual revenue of 2.3 trillion yen. The industry includes various services that exploit legal loopholes.",
