      "headline": "Merger with Disconto-Gesellschaft",
      "text": "In 1929, Deutsche Bank merged with Disconto-Gesellschaft, one of the largest mergers in banking history at the time, significantly increasing its size and influence.",
      "date": "1929"
    },
