      "text": "In 1948, during the period known as 'La Violencia,' peasant self-defense groups began to form in Colombia. These groups were the precursors to the Revolutionary Armed Forces of Colombia (FARC).",
      "date": "1948"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Official Founding of FARC",
      "text": "The Revolutionary Armed Forces of Colombia (FARC) was officially founded in 1966. It emerged from the peasant self-defense groups and adopted a Marxist-Leninist ideology, focusing on agrarianism and anti-imperialism.",
