      "text": "On December 11, 1978, the Lufthansa heist took place at New York City's John F. Kennedy International Airport. An estimated US$5.875 million was stolen, with $5 million in cash and $875,000 in jewelry, making it the largest cash robbery committed in the U.S. at the time.",
