    },
    {
      "headline": "Arrests and Trials",
      "text": "Over the following years, several arrests were made in connection with the heist, including members of the Lucchese crime family. Trials were held, but many involved were either acquitted or never brought to trial due to lack of evidence.",
      "date": "1979"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Jimmy Burke's Arrest",
      "text": "James 'Jimmy the Gent' Burke, believed to be the mastermind behind the heist, was arrested in 1980 on unrelated charges and later convicted for a different crime.",
      "date": "1980"
