      "headline": "Reorganization of Arrondissements",
      "text": "The current spiral pattern of the arrondissements, starting from the center of the city and moving outward in a clockwise direction, was established in 1860. This reorganization was part of the same expansion that increased the number of arrondissements to 20.",
