      "headline": "First Controlled Nuclear Chain Reaction",
      "text": "On December 2, 1942, the first controlled nuclear chain reaction was achieved by Enrico Fermi and his team at the University of Chicago as part of the Manhattan Project. This event marked the birth of nuclear reactors.",
