      "headline": "Construction of Lindisfarne Castle",
      "text": "Lindisfarne Castle was built in 1550 using stones from the dissolved priory. It served as a fortification and later as a residence.",
      "date": "1550"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Designation as an Area of Outstanding Natural Beauty",
      "text": "In the 20th century, Lindisfarne was designated as an Area of Outstanding Natural Beauty, recognizing its unique landscape and historical significance.",
      "date": "1900"
    },
