      "text": "In May 2011, Block, Inc. launched Square Register, a point-of-sale system for iPad, allowing merchants to track sales and inventory.",
      "date": "2011-05"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Partnership with Starbucks",
      "text": "In August 2012, Block, Inc. announced a partnership with Starbucks, where Square would process credit and debit card transactions at Starbucks stores in the United States.",
      "date": "2012-08"
