      "text": "Masada was constructed by Herod the Great as a palace complex and fortress between 37 and 31 BCE.",
      "date": "-0037"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Herod the Great's Reign",
      "text": "During Herod the Great's reign, Masada served as a refuge for him and his family in times of unrest. Herod ruled from 37 BCE until his death in 4 BCE.",
      "date": "-0037"
