      "headline": "Kidnapping and Murders",
      "text": "Between November 1986 and March 1987, Heidnik kidnapped, tortured, and sexually violated six women, murdering two of them, while holding them captive in his basement in Philadelphia.",
      "date": "1986-11"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Arrest and Trial",
      "text": "Heidnik was arrested on March 24, 1987. He was convicted of two counts of first-degree murder and sentenced to death on July 1, 1988.",
      "date": "1987-03-24"
    },
