      "headline": "Introduction of GPRS",
      "text": "In 2000, the General Packet Radio Service (GPRS) was introduced, allowing GSM networks to offer data services and internet access.",
      "date": "2000"
    },
    {
      "headline": "EDGE Technology Introduction",
      "text": "In 2003, Enhanced Data rates for GSM Evolution (EDGE) technology was introduced, providing faster data transmission rates.",
      "date": "2003"
    },
    {
      "headline": "GSM Dominance",
      "text": "By 2004, GSM had become the dominant mobile communication standard worldwide, with over a billion subscribers.",
      "date": "2004"
    },
