    {
      "headline": "Russia Invades Ukraine",
      "text": "On February 24, 2022, Russia launched a full-scale invasion of Ukraine, marking a significant escalation in the Russo-Ukrainian War and leading to widespread international condemnation and sanctions against Russia.",
      "date": "2022-02-24"
    },
    {
      "headline": "James Webb Space Telescope Launched",
