      "headline": "Tallboy Bomb",
      "text": "In 1944, the British Royal Air Force used the Tallboy bomb, one of the first bunker busters, designed by Barnes Wallis. It was used to target German U-boat pens and V-weapon sites.",
      "date": "1944"
