      "text": "Srinagar was founded by the Mauryan Emperor Ashoka in the 3rd century BCE. It was originally named 'Srinagari'.",
      "date": "-0300"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Kushan Empire Influence",
      "text": "During the 1st century CE, Srinagar came under the influence of the Kushan Empire, which contributed to the spread of Buddhism in the region.",
