      "headline": "Impact on Agriculture and Society",
      "text": "The volcanic winter of 536 led to widespread crop failures and food shortages, severely impacting societies across Europe, Asia, and the Americas. The cooling period contributed to social and economic disruptions.",
      "date": "0536"
    },
