    },
    {
      "headline": "Imprisonment and Writing of Autobiography",
      "text": "During her imprisonment following the overthrow, Liliʻuokalani wrote her autobiography, 'Hawaiʻi's Story by Hawaiʻi's Queen', published in 1898.",
      "date": "1898"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Death of Liliʻuokalani",
      "text": "Liliʻuokalani died on November 11, 1917, in Honolulu, Hawaii, at the age of 79.",
