      "headline": "Creation of Brainfuck",
      "text": "Brainfuck was created in 1993 by Swiss student Urban Müller. It was designed to be an extremely minimalistic programming language, consisting of only eight simple commands, a data pointer, and an instruction pointer.",
      "date": "1993"
    },
