      "headline": "Introduction of Colombian Necktie",
      "text": "During La Violencia, the Colombian necktie emerged as a form of execution or post-mortem mutilation. This gruesome method involved pulling the victim's tongue through a deep cut beneath the jaw, leaving it to dangle on the neck. It was used as a method of psychological warfare to intimidate and terrorize.",
