      "headline": "Use of Colombian Necktie in Psychological Warfare",
      "text": "The Colombian necktie was one of several documented types of public mutilation during La Violencia. These methods were intended to scare people away from their land and dehumanize victims.",
      "date": "1948-1958"
    },
