      "text": "The Smithsonian Institution Building, commonly known as the 'Castle,' was completed in 1855 and became the Institution's first building.",
      "date": "1855"
    },
    {
      "headline": "United States National Museum Established",
      "text": "The United States National Museum was established in 1881 as part of the Smithsonian Institution to house and display collections.",
      "date": "1881"
    },
    {
      "headline": "National Air and Space Museum Opens",
      "text": "The National Air and Space Museum, part of the Smithsonian Institution, opened on July 1, 1976, and became one of the most visited museums in the world.",
      "date": "1976-07-01"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Smithsonian's 150th Anniversary",
      "text": "In 1996, the Smithsonian Institution celebrated its 150th anniversary with various events and exhibitions.",
      "date": "1996"
    },
