      "text": "The first edition of the Encyclopædia Britannica was published in Edinburgh, Scotland, in 1768. It was a three-volume set.",
      "date": "1768"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Second Edition Published",
      "text": "The second edition of the Encyclopædia Britannica was published in 1777, expanding to ten volumes.",
      "date": "1777"
    },
