      "text": "The tale of 'Ali Baba and the Forty Thieves' was introduced to the Western world in the 18th century by French translator Antoine Galland. Galland included the story in his translation of 'One Thousand and One Nights' after hearing it from a Syrian storyteller named Hanna Diyab.",
